Active Protocol

The Active Protocol is the operational version of the skill.

So you effectively have two levels:

skill.md

The full specification.

Contains:

* what the system is
* how memory works
* rules
* procedures
* exceptions
* definitions
* enforcement
* architecture

active_protocol

Small, current, immediately actionable.

Contains only:

* what mode we’re in
* which rules are currently active
* what memory behavior applies now
